    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d376-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d376-f1-content">
                <p>According to part II (not printed) of the Pauley–Lubin Report (gee
                        <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#pg_940">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ii</hi>, p. 940</ref>) this supplementary report was presented to
                        Truman at Babelsberg on July 16. The
                    progress report which it supplements is not printed. Concerning the other
                    appendices mentioned in this summary, see the footnotes to the body of the
                    report, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f2" n="2" xml:id="d376-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d364">document No. 364</ref>.</p>
            </note>
