                    </ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f4" n="4" xml:id="d376-f4-content">
                <p>This appendix is identical with attachment 4 to <ref
                        target="frus1945Berlinv02#d894">document No. 894, printed in vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>
                    </ref>, except for minor editorial differences and except that it does not bear
                    the heading “Agreed in the Allied Commission on Reparations”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f5" n="5" xml:id="d376-f5-content">
                <p>This appendix is identical with <ref target="frus1945Berlinv02#d906">document No.
                        906, printed in vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>
                    </ref>, except that the passages italicized in that document were not emphasized
                    in appendix E.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f6" n="6" xml:id="d376-f6-content">
                <p>For the eight principles agreed upon, see <ref target="#d367">document No.
                        367</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
